        detailed: 'Structure lifecycle systems around key milestones: Welcome (new opt-ins), Onboarding (newly enrolled learners finding Lesson 1), Re-Engagement (idle 60 days), and Post-Completion Next Steps. Keep subject lines clear and honest (avoid deceptive "Re:" tricks), write crisp preview text supplementing the subject, use short scannable paragraphs, and focus each email on ONE clear CTA button.',
        concepts: '- Preview Text: Grey summary snippet shown beside Subject Line inside mobile inboxes.\n- Welcome Series: Multi-day automated introduction triggered upon subscription.\n- Single-CTA Rule: Reducing decision fatigue so readers actually click the intended action.',
        steps: 'Step 1: Trigger Email 1 instantly delivering promised asset cleanly.\nStep 2: Send Days 2–4 helpful micro-lessons without heavy sales pressure.\nStep 3: Address top hesitation/proof on Day 5.\nStep 4: Include clear single Call-to-Action button plus crisp mobile-readable text.',
