        shortQ: 'Q1: Why make the Unsubscribe button clear and effortless?\nAnswer: An easy exit causes clean unsubscribes; a hidden exit triggers destructive "Mark as Spam" penalties.\nQ2: What does a Hard Bounce indicate?\nAnswer: Permanently invalid/non-existent email address that must never be mailed again.',
